&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mobile Advertising Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Understanding of mobile advertising ecosystem including app install campaigns, mobile attribution (MMPs), and mobile-specific KPIs such as CPI, LTV, and retention metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relationship &amp;amp; Communication Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated ability to build relationships and communicate effectively with mobile gaming clients, plus excellent presentation skills for mobile campaign performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical &amp;amp; Technical Capabilities:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong analytical skills for mobile campaign data interpretation and familiarity with mobile marketing and attribution technology with eagerness to deepen mobile gaming expertise.&lt;/li&gt;
