&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Analysis and Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Analyze and support gaming accounts with Developer Solutions sales. Monitor and interpret key performance indicators to ensure Developer success and user growth. Watch for outliers and act on them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Development Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as a customer to Sales Enablement and Data Science in the building of quality client-facing materials such as partnership decks, one-sheets, case studies, and presentations to aid in business development efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Planning:&lt;/strong&gt; Formulate strategies for a portfolio of developers to maximize value of activating use of Discord&#39;s tools, leveraging your games industry experience in live operations and monetization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with internal teams and leaders to inform roadmap decisions, implement improvements or adjustments, and ensure successful customer partnerships.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
