&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gaming Industry Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Background in data analysis within a game studio or game ecosystem provider, specifically with hands-on experience in live operations and monetization analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Advanced SQL and data manipulation skills are essential for complex data analysis tasks. Strong analytical capabilities for building optimization strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Attention to Detail:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong focus on accuracy and detail in all aspects of work, with proven ability to identify patterns and optimization opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
