&lt;li&gt;Expertise in Windows applications that interact with Windows Desktop Window Manager (DWM) and/or low-level graphics rendering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical depth with C++ and/or Rust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional problem-solving abilities, with a track record of diagnosing and resolving complex performance issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand observability and monitoring and leverages this to solve system issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
